title: Political Rally
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: rally_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; rally_timer = 6
card-image: img/protest.jpg
go-to: main_rally

@main_rally

We are holding a large rally, with speeches streamed live and clipped for social media. What should its main theme be?

- @class_struggle: Fair shares: the many against the super-rich.
- @welfare: Secure pensions, good care and a strong welfare state.
- @democracy: Defending democracy against the far right.
- @pacifism: Peace, diplomacy and disarmament.
- @wtb: Support the Zukunftsprogramm!
- @local: A mixture of various local and national concerns that resonate most with the audience.
- @easy_discard

@class_struggle
on-arrival: workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if left_strength > reformist_strength; workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if nationalization_progress > 0; left_strength += 5; left_dissent -= 5; old_middle_spd -= 3; new_middle_spd -= 2;

Our message about the super-rich appeals to workers, while it may put off parts of the middle class. [? if nationalization_progress > 0 : Our record on public ownership helps. ?]

@welfare
on-arrival: workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if welfare > 0; unemployed_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if welfare > 1; reformist_strength += 3; labor_strength += 4; reformist_dissent -= 3; labor_dissent -= 3;

Pensions and care matter to almost everyone, and the welfare state is our proudest achievement. [? if welfare > 1 : Our record in expanding it makes the message stronger. ?]

@democracy
on-arrival: democratization += 1; trust_in_democracy += 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3; trust_in_democracy += 4*(1 - dissent) if democratization >= 3; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if democratization >= 3

Our speakers defend the Basic Law and the institutions of the republic against those who want to tear them down.

[? if democratization < 3 : Talk of democracy does not excite voters as much as prices and rents. But that may change. ?]
[? if democratization >= 3 : Since we have made democracy a constant theme, our audience is enthusiastic. ?]

@pacifism
on-arrival: pacifism += 1; nationalism -= 2*(1 - dissent); workers_spd += 4*(1 - dissent) if pacifism >= 3; unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; nationalism -= 3*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3; new_middle_spd += 4*(1-dissent) if pacifism >= 3

Our speakers call for diplomacy before weapons and warn against a new arms race. Willy Brandt's name is mentioned often.

[? if pacifism < 3 : With war in Ukraine, many voters think that this message is naive. ?]
[? if pacifism >= 3 : Since we have made peace a constant theme, our audience is enthusiastic. ?]

@wtb
view-if: investment_adopted = 1
choose-if: return_to_normalcy = 0
unavailable-subtitle: The economic crisis is largely over now, and the public is no longer interested in hearing about it.
on-arrival: investment_support += 1; workers_spd += 6*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 6*(1-dissent); rural_spd += 3*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 3*(1-dissent);

The Zukunftsprogramm has become our rallying cry: new jobs, new rail lines and new schools.


@local
on-arrival: workers_spd += 3*(1-dissent); old_middle_spd += 1*(1-dissent); new_middle_spd += 2*(1-dissent); unemployed_spd += 3*(1-dissent);

Our speakers talk about whatever matters most to the people in the hall: rents, the local hospital, the bus that no longer comes.
